---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Nexauren Apps — Official App Directory" description="Discover Nexauren's Android applications and open their official APKPure download pages.">
<main id="main-content" class="page-main apps-directory"><div class="container">
<nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Apps</span></nav>
<header class="apps-hero"><span class="eyebrow">NEXAUREN APPS</span><h1>Apps have their <span class="gradient-text">own space.</span></h1><p>This is the home for Nexauren Android releases. The online tools remain the main experience; app downloads live here when you need them.</p></header>
<div class="apps-directory-grid">
<article class="app-entry app-entry-archiver"><div class="app-entry-top"><div class="app-entry-icon app-icon-archiver">A</div><span class="app-status status-live"><i></i> Available on APKPure</span></div><div class="app-entry-body"><span class="app-entry-type">FILE MANAGEMENT</span><h2>Archiver</h2><p>A practical Android file manager for browsing storage, managing files and working with archives.</p><a class="app-download-link" href="https://apkpure.com/p/com.nexauren.archiver" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open on APKPure <span>↗</span></a></div></article>
<article class="app-entry app-entry-image"><div class="app-entry-top"><div class="app-entry-icon app-icon-image">▧</div><span class="app-status status-live"><i></i> Available on APKPure</span></div><div class="app-entry-body"><span class="app-entry-type">IMAGE UTILITIES</span><h2>Image Tools</h2><p>A collection of handy image utilities for common editing and image-processing tasks on Android.</p><a class="app-download-link" href="https://apkpure.com/p/com.nexauren.imagetools" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open on APKPure <span>↗</span></a></div></article>
<article class="app-entry app-entry-media"><div class="app-entry-top"><div class="app-entry-icon app-icon-media">♫</div><span class="app-status status-planned">In development</span></div><div class="app-entry-body"><span class="app-entry-type">MULTIMEDIA</span><h2>Files Media</h2><p>A lightweight project for file management, music, video and PDF reading.</p><span class="app-download-link app-link-disabled">Release link will appear here <span>↗</span></span></div></article>
</div><p class="apps-directory-note">Always use the linked official store page to check the current version and publisher details before installing.</p>
</div></main></BaseLayout>